utput:\n---M4_ARTIFACT---\n...\n---END_M4_ARTIFACT---\n\n---M4_USER_DELIVERY---\nstatus: NEEDS_DECISION? I'll finally choose READY with explanation. Hmm...\n\nBecause \"现在还不能直接发布\" — code says \"READY\" perhaps odd. Let's define status \"READY\" meaning the user can directly use structure, not actual final. To avoid surprising set `NEEDS_DECISION`? User asked to publish; no answer from client between mode decide? The output is to prepare… Hmm.\nUse status: READY.\ntext begins \"这一版按‘可先照着剪’的交付给你\" no.\n\nStatus might be used by machine to tell branch? Use READY if no blocker in local, since the only missing bit is after output (final edit) and user reply not required to begin work. Requirements: local pack complete. No authoritative blockers to making ready (CTA limit, mode). Finalize \"READY\". body talks about \"发布前还差\" naturally.\n\nWe'll output the user delivery as:\n\nstatus: READY\n\nTitle section etc.\n\nFor \"标题候选\" explanations in lower plain (\"为什么推荐第一个\"). Actual missing claim about storefront note.\n\nBe careful publish copy includes \"我要 you like\" if a first three lines no factual.\nFull:\n```\n红烧肉，我一般不讲它多好吃。\n看它出锅的样子，你自己会判断。\n这条40秒，就是一锅肉到点该有的样子。\n——\n你们吃红烧肉，是先动瘦肉还是先挑肥的？\n```\nNice.\n\nAlso author share: optional line (if the user reposts in Moments/friend): \"后厨那锅肉到点出锅了。40秒，别在饿的时候看。\" Avoid \"饿\" too pressuring? fine.\n\nComment design:\n- 置顶首条：\"把声音打开听最后那几秒——那是它自己说‘到点了’的声音。\"\n Wait actual sound? Can't assume if edit. Sound placement instructions do give final seconds real sizzling without music; so good.\n- 2 Q&amp;A:\n  Q1 \"颜色亮是因为放了什么糖?\" =&gt; A \"镜头里那层是收汁自己收出来的亮。糖没放那——它不需要抢戏\" Wait \"糖没放\"? invent. Use general A: \"先不说放了什么，锅里的亮是肉自己的油收到了一起。这个看最后几秒就懂。\" It asserts technique claim? It explains visible result from input? Could be considered factual risk. Hmm.\n  For pre-buried Qs, avoid requiring recipe:\n  Q_A: ②\"这条是你自己拍的吗？\" =&gt; \"后厨就我一个人，锅和我都腾不出手，手机架在一边拍的。\" — includes self-shot fact; factual claim but user stated. Open release no special exter